html_export {
    `@reqlan/analytical` builds documentation as HTML from the requirement graph (["./export.rq".export_pipeline], [analysis_scope]).
    Html export should render ideas, attributes, references, and navigable structure suitable for sharing.
    Pipeline: `NativeAnalysisApi.exportHtml` / `AnalysisRuntime.export` → `reqlan-export` snapshot (`build_export_snapshot`) → multi-file static site (`write_html_export`). Single-file mode remains optional via [html_export_runtime_modes].
    Interactive graph/search JS stays bundled static assets ([html_export_graph_layout]), not a second writer (["./rust_port.rq".export_rust]).
    Thin hosts: extension UI (["../extension/export/export.rq".export_webview], ["../extension/export/html-export.rq".html_export_form], ["../extension/export/export.rq".export_html]) and CLI (`reqlan export` / ["../cli/cli_package.rq".commands]).
    Export is scoped to a selected ["../bases/base.rq".base] (not a merged multi-base workspace graph).
    [html_export_multi_file]
    [html_export_internal_links]
    [html_export_idea_tooltips]
    [html_export_layout_cards]
    [html_export_heading_tooltips]
    [html_export_table_columns]
    [html_export_search]
    [html_export_list_views]
    [html_export_overview_links]
    [html_export_idea_pages]
    [html_export_file_pages]
    [html_export_code_reference_pages]
    [html_export_cluster_pages]
    [html_export_graph_page]
    [html_export_attributes_index]
    [html_export_attribute_pages]
    [html_export_printable_pages]
    [html_export_print_idea_cards]
    [html_export_print_body_whitespace]
    [html_export_print_in_page_anchors]
    [html_export_print_all_attributes]
    [html_export_print_button]
    [html_export_print_order_by]
    [html_export_runtime_modes]
    [html_export_scrollable_lists]
    [html_export_header_link]
    [html_export_url_base]
    [html_export_katz_column]
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/mod.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/snapshot.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/types.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-analytical/src/api.rs"]
        ["../../packages/analytical/src/native/native-analysis-api.ts"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:html_export_writes_ts_page_template_set_and_embeds_assets"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:workspace_graph_includes_every_idea_when_max_graph_nodes_is_below_count"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-analytical/tests/export.rs:html_export_honours_graph_page_url_base_and_header_link"]
        ["../../packages/analytical/test/export-html.test.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/test/export-html-native.test.ts"]
    )
}

html_export_multi_file {
    Html export should generate a multi-file static site rather than a single document.
    The export should include page families for overview, ideas, files, code files, clusters, attributes, graph, data, and print-focused pages.
}

html_export_internal_links {
    Every exported idea should have a stable html page path and stable in-page anchors.
    References, breadcrumbs, search results, graph nodes, cluster members, attribute listings, file listings, and code-file listings should link to html pages rather than only showing text labels.
    Overview status/tag rollups and list-table facet cells follow [html_export_overview_links].
    On the printable report, same-page idea links use those in-page anchors per [html_export_print_in_page_anchors].
    Graph node links must follow [html_export_graph_links].
    When [html_export_url_base] is set, those same links must be root-relative under the mount prefix so static hosts resolve them with or without a trailing slash.
    A link `[idea.attribute]` opens that attribute on the idea page. See ["../language/syntax.rq".attribute_namespacing].
    A link to an idea shows that idea's body in a tooltip per [html_export_idea_tooltips].
}

html_export_idea_tooltips {
    A link to an idea must show a tooltip when the pointer or keyboard focus rests on the link.
    The tooltip must show the idea name, the source file, and the idea body text.
    The tooltip must show the status when the idea has a status.
    The tooltip must be a styled panel. The tooltip must not use the browser title text.
    The tooltip must stay inside the viewport.
    An unresolved reference must not show an idea tooltip.
    Section and card heading tips follow [html_export_heading_tooltips].
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_utils.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/mod.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/app.js"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/styles.css"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:idea_links_show_content_tooltips"]
    )
}

html_export_layout_cards {
    In interactive runtime mode, detail-page panels (panel, table-shell, graph-shell) and entity-card tiles are drag-reorderable within their layout group and collapsible.
    In interactive mode, cards that are direct children of a page layout group and use panel, table-shell, or graph-shell chrome are width-resizable by column span.
    Entity-card tiles inside an entity-list layout group are drag-reorderable and collapsible, but they are not width-resizable.
    Column hide and column width on tables stay separate from card width.
    Width-resizable cards sit in a responsive multi-column grid and snap to column spans so a card can take one column, several columns, or the full row.
    Double-click on the card width handle fills the row. A second double-click restores the last non-full span. Collapsed cards ignore fill.
    Narrow viewports collapse spans so cards stack without horizontal overflow.
    The full card header is the drag handle. Links, buttons, and inputs in the header still activate on click.
    The collapse caret stays hidden until the card is hovered or has focus within.
    Collapse hides the card body and shrinks the card chrome so the layout does not keep empty body space.
    Card-width and header drag must not lose control to text selection: pointer capture, select lock, and preventDefault on resize pointerdown.
    Order, collapse, column-span, and fill-restore state persist in localStorage for that page path.
    Document and print runtime modes keep a static layout with no rearrange, resize, or collapse behaviour.
    Printable-report idea cards stay outside this idea ([html_export_print_idea_cards], [html_export_print_order_by]).
    Table column chrome follows [html_export_table_columns].
    Cross-refs [html_export_runtime_modes], [html_export_heading_tooltips].
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/layout.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/mod.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/app.js"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/styles.css"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:interactive_layout_cards_are_reorderable_collapsible_with_heading_tips"]
    )
}

html_export_table_columns {
    In interactive runtime mode, tables inside layout cards let the user hide and resize columns.
    An eye control on each column header toggles that column. The eye shows when the header cell is hovered or focused.
    A column-selector control in the table card header opens a multiselect panel with search, select all, clear, and shift-click range selection.
    Column resize must not lose control to text selection: pointer capture, select lock, and a resize handle above selectable header text.
    Hidden columns and column widths persist in localStorage for that page path and table.
    Document and print runtime modes keep all columns visible at default widths with no column chrome.
    Cross-refs [html_export_layout_cards], [html_export_list_views].
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/app.js"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/styles.css"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:interactive_layout_cards_are_reorderable_collapsible_with_heading_tips"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:html_export_writes_ts_page_template_set_and_embeds_assets"]
    )
}

html_export_heading_tooltips {
    Section headings on layout panels show a short descriptive tip via the styled tooltip panel when pointer or keyboard focus rests on the heading.
    Entity-card title headings tip with that card's short summary text.
    Idea title headings tip with the idea summary when present.
    Heading tips must not use the browser title text.
    Reuses the tooltip surface from [html_export_idea_tooltips].
    Cross-refs [html_export_layout_cards].
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/layout.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/app.js"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/styles.css"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:interactive_layout_cards_are_reorderable_collapsible_with_heading_tips"]
    )
}

html_export_search {
    The interactive html export should provide a global search bar and page-local search bars.
    Search should work offline from generated data bundled with the export.
    Attribute keys and values should be searchable alongside ideas, files, code files, and clusters.
}

html_export_list_views {
    Html export should provide searchable list views for ideas, files, code files, references, clusters, and attributes.
    List views should preserve the usability of the current ideas summary tables with counts, sorting, filters, and quick navigation.
    Every interactive table column should be sortable by header click and filterable with a per-column filter, in addition to any page-level search bar.
    Navigable facet cells in those tables (status, tags, paths, attribute values, cluster labels/kinds) should be links to the matching detail page or to a list page with the matching column filter applied via [html_export_overview_links].
    Long lists that sit above other page content follow [html_export_scrollable_lists].
    The ideas index count columns follow [html_export_ideas_ref_columns].
    Column hide, resize, and selector chrome follow [html_export_table_columns].
    [html_export_ideas_ref_columns]
    [html_export_table_columns]
    [html_export_attributes_index]
    [html_export_file_pages]
    [html_export_code_reference_pages]
    [html_export_scrollable_lists]
    [html_export_overview_links]
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/mod.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_utils.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/app.js"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:html_export_writes_ts_page_template_set_and_embeds_assets"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:ideas_index_splits_inbound_and_outbound_counts"]
    )
}

html_export_ideas_ref_columns {
    The ideas index table shows inbound reference counts and outbound reference counts in two columns.
    The first count column is In. The second count column is Out.
    Each cell shows one integer.
    Each column has its own header sort and column filter.
    Filter keys are `in` and `out`.
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/mod.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/styles.css"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:ideas_index_splits_inbound_and_outbound_counts"]
    )
}

html_export_katz_column {
    HTML export shows the inbound Katz score (["../modelling/advanced_analysis.rq".katz_centrality]) for each idea.
    The ideas index adds a Katz column after Out.
    File idea tables, code-file idea tables, cluster member tables, and attribute idea tables add a Katz column.
    The printable file sheet, code-file sheet, and cluster sheet add the same column.
    The idea page and the printable idea sheet show the same score as a metric.
    The cell text uses 3 decimal places. The sort value is the full score.
    The filter key is `katz`.
    File, cluster, and attribute index tables do not show this column.
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/snapshot.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/types.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/mod.rs"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:idea_tables_show_a_katz_column"]
    )
    @status done
}

html_export_overview_links {
    The interactive overview page status rollup, tags rollup, and highlighted clusters must be interactive navigation, not plain labels.
    Status and tag rollup entries should open the matching status/tag cluster page when [html_export_cluster_pages] is enabled; otherwise they should open the ideas list with the Status or Tags column filter seeded from the rollup key.
    Highlighted clusters should open the matching cluster page (or the clusters index when cluster pages are disabled).
    List pages must honour URL query parameters that seed per-column filters (for example `ideas.html?status=todo` or `ideas.html?tags=export`) so overview and in-table facet links land with the filter already applied.
    Query keys match stable `data-filter-key` values on table headers; filter values use the same display labels as the rollup (including Not present / Empty).
    Cross-refs [html_export_list_views], [html_export_cluster_pages], [html_export_internal_links].
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/mod.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_utils.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/assets/app.js"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:overview_status_and_tag_rollups_link_with_filters"]
    )
}

html_export_idea_pages {
    Html export should generate a dedicated page per idea.
    Idea pages should include summary, attributes, inbound references, outbound references, nearby context, and links to related ideas, files, clusters, graph views, and printable forms.
    Status and tags are nullable attributes: render them only when present.
}

html_export_file_pages {
    Html export should generate dedicated pages for reqlan source files that host ideas in the export scope.
    File pages should list hosted ideas, related clusters, and a local graph view when available.
    Emission defaults on and is controllable via includeFilePages so page families can be flagged in or out without changing the export pipeline shape.
    Graph nodes and idea source-file links for hosting files should resolve to these pages when enabled.
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/types.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/snapshot.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html_template/mod.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/html.rs"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/tests/html_export.rs:html_export_writes_ts_page_template_set_and_embeds_assets"]
    )
}

html_export_code_reference_pages {
    Html export should generate dedicated pages for outbound file_reference targets and inbound comment_link code files that are not idea-hosting reqlan files already covered by [html_export_file_pages].
    Code-file pages should list referencing ideas and reference labels, and participate in search and navigation.
    Emission defaults on and is controllable via includeCodeFilePages so this page family can be flagged in or out later.
    Outbound reference path cells and graph external file nodes should link to these pages when enabled.
    Comment-linked files: ["../indexer/indexer.rq".index_code_files].
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/types.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-export/src/snapshot.rs"]
